# Preserve raw tool output byte-for-byte, including Windows line endings and
# unittest's emitted trailing spaces. Source/config/document rules stay intact.
**/stdout.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol
**/stderr.txt whitespace=-blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol
acceptance-*/** whitespace=-blank-at-eol,cr-at-eol
